        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona umwi angelo uliimvwi muzuba. Oyo angelo wakalila ajwi ipati, wakabaambila bayuni boonse bauluka mujulu, wakati, Amuboole, muzoolibunganye kumulalilo mupati wa-Leza, ",
