        {
          "text": "Lino cinyama cakajatwa, alakwe musinsimi mubeji iwakali kucita kunembo lyaco zigambyo zyakubeena abo ibakatambwide bulembo bwacinyama abaabo ibakali kukomba cikozyano caco. Aba bobile bakasowegwa bulanga muziba lyamulilo uuyakisya asulufa. ",
